        Under the 7th CPC, employees were mapped across <strong>18 distinct Pay Levels</strong>. Below is a side-by-side comparison of entry basic pay across every level, contrasting 7th CPC baselines with projected 8th CPC scales at <strong>2.25x</strong> (economic baseline) and <strong>2.86x</strong> (federation target):
      </p>

